  m_Text: "Greetings new employee, and welcome to the Seriph \uA66E Worldwide No.2
    warehouse!\n\nYou will be responsible for collecting materials \u23FF\u23FF\u23FF\u23FF\u23FFrequired
    by our customers and delivering them to outbound transports via our package transport
    conveyor\n\nPlease collect your Seriph \uA66E Worldwide QR scanner from the table
    below. This scanner will allow you to check the part number of any package inside
    the warehouse\n\nAll Seriph \uA66E Worldwide property must be deposited back
    on the table before the employee can exit the warehouse. In the event of a fire,
    please make this a priority."
