  m_Text: "The Daily order board beside the conveyor will list a set of packages
    that need to be collected and placed on the loading conveyor.  Each package has
    the following:\n- an ID number\n- A description of the contents\n- A location
    number. \n\nLocation numbers are divided into Shelf-Row-Column. See the signs
    on the shelves (shelf,row) and the walls (column) to aid in locating these. Each
    location number may have multiple packages - keep that scanner handy!\n\nAnd
    remember, you are on the clock.\n\nPS - breakages or mislaid packages will be
    deducted from your budget"
